1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's play The Book of Answers.</font>

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time, will I</font>

3
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get to talk to the girl I like?</font>

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Book of Answers]</font>

5
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Got your answer on affection yet?]</font>

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Welcome to the Island of Affection]</font>

7
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Trust in fate]</font>

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Such a clear, sunny day today]</font>

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tianqing is over there]
[*Tianqing means 'clear skies']</font>

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yuting is right here]
[*Her name sounds like 'rain stops']</font>

11
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Rainbow]</font>

12
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[After the rain, clear skies for us]
[*Ally's name sounds like 'rain']</font>

13
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Nothing beats fate]</font>

14
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Did you know I'd pick you]</font>

15
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[How are we twinning like this]</font>

16
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Because I'm into blue]</font>

17
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I'm into blue too]</font>

18
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Talk about fate]</font>

19
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[It really is meant to be]</font>

20
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Be yourself, and someone will
always show you affection]</font>

21
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[People often say I'm a bit dull]</font>

22
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I just don't want to
stay like this anymore]</font>

23
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I think you're cute in a goofy way]</font>

24
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You're totally my type]</font>

25
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Her voice is really nice though]</font>

26
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Oh my God]</font>

27
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[It's that mature boss-lady voice]</font>

28
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A little sweet too, huh]</font>

29
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Live in the moment]</font>

30
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Is someone leaving
the island tomorrow]</font>

31
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[It's okay, I voted for you]</font>

32
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Don't worry]</font>

33
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[...still get more
time on the island]</font>

34
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I don't want to leave so soon anyway]</font>

35
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[We're already here, so why not]</font>

36
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Day Two Departures]</font>

37
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gotta wear our sharpest fits tomorrow]</font>

38
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Let's all dress to impress]</font>

39
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[One last dance]</font>

40
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fortune favors the bold in love]</font>

41
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Today's Affection Moon Phase:
Crescent Moon]</font>

42
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fill out the departure card]
What day is it on the island?</font>

43
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Day two.</font>

44
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who do I want to ask?</font>

45
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you guys write?</font>

46
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mind is completely blank.</font>

47
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What? We have to write this much?</font>

48
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak from the heart, you know?</font>

49
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you already good to go?</font>

50
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yep.</font>

51
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, no fair!</font>

52
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This looks good. Pretty sharp.</font>

53
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I usually only wear this out</font>

54
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for really important social events.</font>

55
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bringing out the big guns today!</font>

56
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I don't wear it today,
I won't get another chance.</font>

57
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looking sharp, aren't I]</font>

58
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, I'll head out first.</font>

59
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Huang Siyang, Ren Chunxi]
Does it look better with a belt?</font>

60
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, much better.</font>

61
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Way better.</font>

62
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Trotting over]</font>

63
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hi~]
Hello.</font>

64
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hello, hello]
Hello.</font>

65
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

66
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go outside and chat for a bit.</font>

67
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Taking the initiative]
Okay.</font>

68
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sun's just a bit harsh.</font>

69
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on.</font>

70
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a sec.</font>

71
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What was I doing?</font>

72
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to grab a bottle of water.</font>

73
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You tied your hair up.</font>

74
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I tied it up.</font>

75
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. Can we use an umbrella?</font>

76
00:03:39,430 --> 00:03:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

77
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should take the umbrella.
It's really hot.</font>

78
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about we go to the restaurant?</font>

79
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's way too hot.</font>

80
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sounds good.</font>

81
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want to share the umbrella?</font>

82
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

83
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You use it.</font>

84
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

85
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you hungry?</font>

86
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:03,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not really.</font>

87
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like I wake up
too early every morning.</font>

88
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you get enough to eat?</font>

89
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm full.</font>

90
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">'Cause we whipped up some</font>

91
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more late-night snacks last night.</font>

92
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, what?</font>

93
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:12,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right in the cafeteria.</font>

94
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really? What time?</font>

95
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Around...</font>

96
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys went after taking a shower?</font>

97
00:04:19,270 --> 00:04:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

98
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went right after voting
with the Moonstones.</font>

99
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our dorm leader fought for it,</font>

100
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we cooked it ourselves.</font>

101
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you guys make?</font>

102
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just noodles and eggs and stuff.</font>

103
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

104
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go sit on the sofa.</font>

105
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, let's sit there and chat a bit.</font>

106
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's sit on the sofa.</font>

107
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

108
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It looks so silly.</font>

109
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too silly.</font>

110
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Turn around for a sec.</font>

111
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't look at me.</font>

112
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So silly.</font>

113
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too silly.</font>

114
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Takes out glasses]</font>

115
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I see you wear them tomorrow then?</font>

116
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really want to see you in glasses.</font>

117
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

118
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So silly.</font>

119
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I turn around now?</font>

120
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

121
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It looks so silly.</font>

122
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Complimenting]
I see them.</font>

123
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you look really cute.</font>

124
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do they look good?
Is it a big difference?</font>

125
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

126
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's fine.</font>

127
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you look really cute.</font>

128
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

129
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think yourself?</font>

130
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It just looks a bit dorky, right?</font>

131
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">'Cause they're round frames.</font>

132
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That shirt of yours…</font>

133
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

134
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I look kinda dorky, huh?</font>

135
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So these ones are non-prescription?</font>

136
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, these are non-prescription.</font>

137
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you ever tried square frames?</font>

138
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like they'd suit you really well.</font>

139
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Square glasses, I mean.</font>

140
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:41,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've tried square ones before.</font>

141
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're okay.</font>

142
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just used to wearing these,
so I stick with them.</font>

143
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually thought</font>

144
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might not get the chance
to wear these at all.</font>

145
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you look really cute.</font>

146
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad, huh?</font>

147
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

148
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do I look different from yesterday?</font>

149
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yesterday vs. Today]</font>

150
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your makeup isn't as…</font>

151
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

152
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just your...</font>

153
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know the right term for it.</font>

154
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like around your eyes,</font>

155
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's not as heavy.</font>

156
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

157
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Overall, you look a lot brighter.</font>

158
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's because you didn't go
dark around here, right?</font>

159
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fair enough.</font>

160
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.
Let's grab something to eat.</font>

161
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

162
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things are moving pretty fast.</font>

163
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like, I just have to...</font>

164
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you mean just now?</font>

165
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't even finish talking yesterday.</font>

166
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:47,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to pump the brakes a bit.</font>

167
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sheng's living the dream again.</font>

168
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lucky him.</font>

169
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:03,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Play The Book of Answers for a bit.</font>

170
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time, will I</font>

171
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get to talk to the girl I like?</font>

172
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean privately,</font>

173
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a one-on-one chat.</font>

174
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that possible?</font>

175
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,480
