239
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell me.</font>

240
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be together?</font>

241
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Filter out the noise.</font>

242
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Filter out the noise.</font>

243
