316
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

317
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so hot.</font>

318
