321
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Happy]</font>

322
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Secretly thrilled]</font>

323
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Seeing through it but saying nothing]</font>

324
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I seriously admire you guys.</font>

325
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,600
