339
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hu Ke'er, please step forward.</font>

340
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so scared when they called me.</font>

341
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:30,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly,</font>

342
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to run away.</font>

343
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really didn't know what to do.</font>

344
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

345
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:39,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Sheng, please step forward.</font>

346
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ally Liu, please step forward.</font>

347
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But they probably have
