348
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They survived, right?</font>

349
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's so mean! What are they up to?</font>

350
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,630
