811
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you seen Doctor Strange?</font>

812
00:36:22,760 --> 00:36:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you seen Doctor Strange?</font>

813
