<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Have you seen Doctor Strange?]
We still have to answer him?</font>

814
00:36:25,360 --> 00:36:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He won't even let us sit,
