<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All the soccer guys I know</font>

1038
00:42:42,520 --> 00:42:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">always seem prone to heatstroke</font>

1039
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sweat a lot.</font>

1040
00:42:48,640 --> 00:42:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So the first time you saw me,</font>

1041
00:42:50,120 --> 00:42:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you thought I was a soccer player?</font>

1042
00:42:51,200 --> 00:42:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

1043
00:42:55,080 --> 00:42:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything else?</font>

1044
00:42:56,720 --> 00:42:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then could you tie my apron for me?</font>

1045
00:42:58,120 --> 00:42:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Puppy-dog request]</font>

1046
00:42:59,640 --> 00:43:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want black or red?</font>

1047
00:43:01,840 --> 00:43:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which looks better on me?</font>

1048
00:43:03,160 --> 00:43:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you'd look good</font>

1049
00:43:06,200 --> 00:43:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in red today.</font>

1050
00:43:07,920 --> 00:43:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's more eye-catching.</font>

1051
00:43:09,400 --> 00:43:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1052
00:43:10,680 --> 00:43:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Behold our grand master chef,</font>

1053
00:43:12,800 --> 00:43:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chef Yang!</font>

1054
00:43:26,720 --> 00:43:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tight enough?</font>

1055
00:43:27,600 --> 00:43:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yep, perfect.</font>

1056
00:43:27,960 --> 00:43:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chef.</font>

1057
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

1058
00:43:37,560 --> 00:43:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now, I've firmly decided on Ally.</font>

1059
00:43:39,840 --> 00:43:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She might</font>

1060
00:43:40,880 --> 00:43:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really meet other guys</font>

1061
00:43:43,120 --> 00:43:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she's more into,</font>

1062
00:43:44,120 --> 00:43:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who are a bit better than me,</font>

1063
00:43:45,440 --> 00:43:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then there's nothing I can do, right?</font>

1064
00:43:47,600 --> 00:43:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Won't cutting peppers like that
burn your hands?</font>

1065
00:43:50,000 --> 00:43:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like this? I don't think so.</font>

1066
00:43:51,560 --> 00:43:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cutting peppers usually
makes your hands burn.</font>

1067
00:43:54,520 --> 00:43:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What, you wanna hold hands with me?</font>

1068
00:43:56,440 --> 00:43:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[What, you wanna hold hands with me]</font>

1069
00:43:57,400 --> 00:43:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's impressive.</font>

1070
00:43:58,160 --> 00:43:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[That's impressive]</font>

1071
00:43:59,800 --> 00:44:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is way too short. Look at me,</font>

1072
00:44:01,120 --> 00:44:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's like you put a quilt over me.</font>

1073
00:44:03,440 --> 00:44:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me loosen it for you then.</font>

1074
00:44:06,800 --> 00:44:09,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me help you cut the peppers, okay?</font>

1075
00:44:09,200 --> 00:44:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't cut them, okay?</font>

1076
00:44:10,520 --> 00:44:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I really want to cut the peppers.</font>

1077
00:44:12,240 --> 00:44:14,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then grab a knife and cut them, okay?</font>

1078
00:44:14,400 --> 00:44:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

1079
00:44:19,200 --> 00:44:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you guys making?</font>

1080
00:44:19,960 --> 00:44:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're making a lunch full of love.</font>

1081
00:44:21,400 --> 00:44:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lunch made with love]</font>

1082
00:44:23,440 --> 00:44:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

1083
00:44:23,920 --> 00:44:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're sweating.</font>

1084
00:44:24,760 --> 00:44:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1085
00:44:26,120 --> 00:44:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you wipe my sweat for me?</font>

1086
00:44:27,200 --> 00:44:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao.</font>

1087
00:44:28,240 --> 00:44:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Me?]</font>

1088
00:44:30,360 --> 00:44:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I'm not wiping your sweat!]
I'm not wiping your sweat!</font>

1089
00:44:31,240 --> 00:44:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me help you with that.</font>

1090
00:44:32,920 --> 00:44:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly. How could you ask me to do it?</font>

1091
00:44:35,640 --> 00:44:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just the sidekick.</font>

1092
00:44:40,160 --> 00:44:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make sure none of your
sweat drops into the food!</font>

1093
00:44:46,560 --> 00:44:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All done?</font>

1094
00:44:47,680 --> 00:44:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not yet, still some on your nose.</font>

1095
00:44:57,520 --> 00:45:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you sweating so much, though?</font>

1096
00:45:00,040 --> 00:45:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you really sensitive to heat?</font>

1097
00:45:01,200 --> 00:45:02,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seeing you makes me nervous.</font>

1098
00:45:03,760 --> 00:45:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For real?</font>

1099
00:45:04,560 --> 00:45:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

1100
00:45:10,720 --> 00:45:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what I feel like right now?</font>

1101
00:45:13,040 --> 00:45:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A sidekick.</font>

1102
00:45:13,920 --> 00:45:15,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The big boss is working right here,</font>

1103
00:45:15,400 --> 00:45:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the sidekick is anticipating
your needs right here.</font>

1104
00:45:18,720 --> 00:45:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Having a sidekick like
you isn't bad at all.</font>

1105
00:45:20,960 --> 00:45:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Remember to protect me, okay]
Remember to protect me, okay?</font>

1106
00:45:22,600 --> 00:45:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Carry me to victory in the game!]
Carry me to victory in the game!</font>

1107
00:45:24,120 --> 00:45:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deal.</font>

1108
00:45:25,120 --> 00:45:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got this!</font>

1109
00:45:32,600 --> 00:45:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[*Walks past*]</font>

1110
00:45:37,080 --> 00:45:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That works.</font>

1111
00:45:37,800 --> 00:45:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should move your hand away,</font>

1112
00:45:39,120 --> 00:45:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">otherwise you might cut yourself.</font>

1113
00:45:40,520 --> 00:45:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Beginner to Quitter]
Never mind, you should take over.</font>

1114
00:45:43,160 --> 00:45:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just cheer for us, okay?</font>

1115
00:45:45,120 --> 00:45:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just tomato scrambled eggs, right?</font>

1116
00:45:46,200 --> 00:45:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go for it!</font>

1117
00:45:49,920 --> 00:45:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can make the cheesy
stringy tomato scrambled eggs.</font>

1118
00:45:51,960 --> 00:45:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the one you make, right?</font>

1119
00:45:53,480 --> 00:45:54,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

1120
00:45:54,360 --> 00:45:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, do it like this.</font>

1121
00:45:54,960 --> 00:45:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because we changed our plan.</font>

1122
00:45:56,280 --> 00:45:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're making spaghetti bolognese.</font>

1123
00:45:57,960 --> 00:45:58,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

1124
00:45:58,400 --> 00:45:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give</font>

1125
00:46:00,560 --> 00:46:01,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xinran a hand.</font>

1126
00:46:02,840 --> 00:46:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's making tomato scrambled eggs.</font>

1127
00:46:03,720 --> 00:46:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait,
you haven't finished helping me yet!</font>

1128
00:46:07,720 --> 00:46:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No rush.</font>

1129
00:46:08,520 --> 00:46:09,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can lend a hand anywhere,</font>

1130
00:46:09,880 --> 00:46:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you know?</font>

1131
00:46:10,720 --> 00:46:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should help her make the cheesy one,</font>

1132
00:46:11,960 --> 00:46:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because you know how to make it, right?</font>

1133
00:46:13,120 --> 00:46:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

1134
00:46:14,720 --> 00:46:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

1135
00:46:15,440 --> 00:46:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll definitely get yours done first,
okay?</font>

1136
00:46:21,640 --> 00:46:22,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong? Can't cut it again?</font>

1137
00:46:22,880 --> 00:46:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe switching knives would help?</font>

1138
00:46:24,680 --> 00:46:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It should be like this.</font>

1139
00:46:27,240 --> 00:46:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It came loose.</font>

1140
00:46:28,120 --> 00:46:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does this need to be peeled?</font>

1141
00:46:29,480 --> 00:46:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks like it.</font>

1142
00:46:30,240 --> 00:46:31,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you hold this?</font>

1143
00:46:31,880 --> 00:46:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go peel it.</font>

1144
00:46:32,800 --> 00:46:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Joining the soup prep team]
Thanks for the help.</font>

1145
00:46:33,680 --> 00:46:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

1146
00:46:40,480 --> 00:46:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prep work done]</font>

1147
00:46:43,680 --> 00:46:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you need this,
I'll just leave it there.</font>

1148
00:46:45,080 --> 00:46:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, thanks.</font>

1149
00:46:46,200 --> 00:46:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're actually thanking me?</font>

1150
00:46:48,520 --> 00:46:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, little bro. Little bro.</font>

1151
00:46:49,960 --> 00:46:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did chop all this for you, you know.</font>

1152
00:46:51,320 --> 00:46:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's true.</font>

1153
00:46:53,240 --> 00:46:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dicing chicken breast]</font>

1154
00:47:04,360 --> 00:47:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Watching closely]</font>

1155
00:47:16,120 --> 00:47:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I help you with anything?</font>

1156
00:47:17,920 --> 00:47:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I help you with anything?</font>

1157
00:47:19,080 --> 00:47:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Stepping in to help]</font>

1158
00:47:19,680 --> 00:47:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you chop this for me?</font>

1159
00:47:21,120 --> 00:47:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just cut it all into sections.</font>

1160
00:47:23,640 --> 00:47:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since I don't really like cooking,</font>

1161
00:47:25,000 --> 00:47:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">back then...</font>

1162
00:47:26,440 --> 00:47:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to spend more time
interacting with Wang Sheng.</font>

1163
00:47:29,760 --> 00:47:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I took the initiative to ask him</font>

1164
00:47:31,040 --> 00:47:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if he needed any help.</font>

1165
00:47:32,640 --> 00:47:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm super easygoing
when it comes to food.</font>

1166
00:47:35,160 --> 00:47:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not picky at all,</font>

1167
00:47:36,680 --> 00:47:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can eat pretty much anything.</font>

1168
00:47:38,440 --> 00:47:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about you?
Do you cook for yourself?</font>

1169
00:47:40,120 --> 00:47:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I cook, I just boil everything.</font>

1170
00:47:42,840 --> 00:47:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I buy that Guizhou chili dip.</font>

1171
00:47:45,240 --> 00:47:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really good when you dip it in.</font>

1172
00:47:47,920 --> 00:47:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you eat really spicy food?</font>

1173
00:47:50,280 --> 00:47:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not really, but if it's just boiled,</font>

1174
00:47:52,440 --> 00:47:54,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't stomach it without chili dip.</font>

1175
00:47:54,360 --> 00:47:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just bland.</font>

1176
00:47:57,280 --> 00:47:58,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay,</font>

1177
00:47:58,400 --> 00:47:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">okay, thanks.</font>

1178
00:47:59,240 --> 00:48:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Compliment my chopping in three words.</font>

1179
00:48:02,920 --> 00:48:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fast.</font>

1180
00:48:04,240 --> 00:48:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fast, neat, clean]
Also really neat. And clean.</font>

1181
00:48:06,320 --> 00:48:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

1182
00:48:08,760 --> 00:48:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Starts stir-frying]</font>

1183
00:48:19,840 --> 00:48:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it so pungent?</font>

1184
00:48:23,840 --> 00:48:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One person is choking the entire room.</font>

1185
00:48:31,160 --> 00:48:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's do this:</font>

1186
00:48:31,680 --> 00:48:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the loser has to go over and
smell it for five seconds.</font>

1187
00:48:33,560 --> 00:48:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm already taking damage over here,</font>

1188
00:48:35,120 --> 00:48:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you know?</font>

1189
00:48:35,600 --> 00:48:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's an AoE attack.</font>

1190
00:48:36,920 --> 00:48:37,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

1191
00:48:39,360 --> 00:48:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pats]
Siyang,</font>

1192
00:48:41,400 --> 00:48:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get out quick.</font>

1193
00:48:42,640 --> 00:48:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The smoke will choke you.</font>

1194
00:48:44,840 --> 00:48:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I have the first taste?</font>

1195
00:48:46,760 --> 00:48:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

1196
00:48:58,840 --> 00:48:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it spicy?</font>

1197
00:49:01,200 --> 00:49:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so good!</font>

1198
00:49:03,200 --> 00:49:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I try one too?</font>

1199
00:49:04,240 --> 00:49:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, hold on a second, just a moment.</font>

1200
00:49:06,880 --> 00:49:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grab a bite.</font>

1201
00:49:07,960 --> 00:49:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a bite, give it a try.</font>

1202
00:49:10,560 --> 00:49:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick, wipe my sweat.</font>

1203
00:49:12,200 --> 00:49:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1204
00:49:12,840 --> 00:49:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's gonna drip onto that plate.</font>

1205
00:49:14,160 --> 00:49:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a kitchen towel.</font>

1206
00:49:16,840 --> 00:49:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so good!</font>

1207
00:49:21,640 --> 00:49:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just leave it there.
I don't want the fumes to choke you.</font>

1208
00:49:22,760 --> 00:49:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Were you trying to feed
