<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi, your last name is quite uncommon.</font>

2401
01:36:29,200 --> 01:36:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got one!</font>

2402
01:36:30,200 --> 01:36:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Anticipation]</font>

2403
01:36:32,520 --> 01:36:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your last name is quite uncommon too.</font>

2404
01:36:35,720 --> 01:36:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hundred Family Surnames:
Zhao, Qian, Sun, Li...]</font>

2405
01:36:37,520 --> 01:36:38,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, it's literally in the
Hundred Family Surnames!</font>

2406
01:36:41,080 --> 01:36:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lowers head in shame]</font>

2407
01:36:44,120 --> 01:36:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tactical sip of water]</font>

2408
01:36:48,880 --> 01:36:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Silence is the main theme tonight]</font>

2409
01:36:53,400 --> 01:36:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Waiting]</font>

2410
01:36:59,720 --> 01:37:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In anticipation]</font>

2411
01:37:01,120 --> 01:37:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Tianqing,
please proceed to the date zone.</font>

2412
01:37:03,800 --> 01:37:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Yuning Invites Wang Tianqing]</font>

2413
01:37:12,000 --> 01:37:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No,</font>

2414
01:37:15,000 --> 01:37:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's completely normal.</font>

2415
01:37:21,200 --> 01:37:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really want to get to know him better.</font>

2416
01:37:23,880 --> 01:37:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, didn't Siyang (Huang Siyang)</font>

2417
01:37:24,680 --> 01:37:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">win too?</font>

2418
01:37:25,560 --> 01:37:26,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he wanted to choose me,</font>

2419
01:37:26,240 --> 01:37:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he could have chosen me, right?</font>

2420
01:37:28,640 --> 01:37:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Tianqing] But I also have
someone I want to get to know.</font>

2421
01:37:32,720 --> 01:37:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we won,</font>

2422
01:37:33,600 --> 01:37:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ally (Liu Yuning) and I</font>

2423
01:37:34,560 --> 01:37:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were so happy.</font>

2424
01:37:35,880 --> 01:37:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it was a given that</font>

2425
01:37:36,840 --> 01:37:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the two of us were going on a date.</font>

2426
01:37:38,560 --> 01:37:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I excitedly came home,</font>

2427
01:37:40,600 --> 01:37:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">put on my orange shirt,</font>

2428
01:37:43,320 --> 01:37:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Carefully styled shirt] and
sprayed a ton of cologne.</font>

2429
01:37:45,440 --> 01:37:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But she chose another guy</font>

2430
01:37:47,520 --> 01:37:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was interested in.</font>

2431
01:37:48,920 --> 01:37:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't really like having my rhythm</font>

2432
01:37:51,760 --> 01:37:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">thrown off like this.</font>

2433
01:37:53,280 --> 01:37:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It completely caught me off guard.</font>

2434
01:38:00,600 --> 01:38:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never expected her to ask me out.</font>

2435
01:38:03,000 --> 01:38:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the fact that she still chose me</font>

2436
01:38:04,480 --> 01:38:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes me really happy.</font>

2437
01:38:08,880 --> 01:38:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font>

2438
01:38:15,680 --> 01:38:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You surprised I picked you?</font>

2439
01:38:16,880 --> 01:38:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2440
01:38:17,800 --> 01:38:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is that?</font>

2441
01:38:18,480 --> 01:38:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I felt like
you were getting along</font>

2442
01:38:21,560 --> 01:38:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pretty well with that tall guy</font>

2443
01:38:22,960 --> 01:38:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">today.</font>

2444
01:38:24,800 --> 01:38:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jealous tone] And you
guys were on the same team,</font>

2445
01:38:25,880 --> 01:38:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and even won.</font>

2446
01:38:26,960 --> 01:38:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we were on the same team yesterday.</font>

2447
01:38:28,680 --> 01:38:30,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, we were on the same
team yesterday, I know.</font>

2448
01:38:30,240 --> 01:38:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Acting tough but jealous] And you
two cooked together too, right?</font>

2449
01:38:32,640 --> 01:38:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because when you were cooking,</font>

2450
01:38:33,480 --> 01:38:35,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you didn't seem to need
any help or anything.</font>

2451
01:38:35,200 --> 01:38:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And since you weren't talking either...</font>

2452
01:38:38,280 --> 01:38:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I wasn't really...</font>

2453
01:38:39,960 --> 01:38:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me drink some water first,
I'm a bit nervous.</font>

2454
01:38:43,120 --> 01:38:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[*Stares warmly*]</font>

2455
01:38:44,400 --> 01:38:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want to try something else?</font>

2456
01:38:46,520 --> 01:38:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you had any?</font>

2457
01:38:47,520 --> 01:38:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't. I was waiting for you.</font>

2458
01:38:48,800 --> 01:38:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead and eat first.</font>

2459
01:38:50,400 --> 01:38:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tried the food you made today.</font>

2460
01:38:51,480 --> 01:38:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was really good.</font>

2461
01:38:52,640 --> 01:38:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't help out,</font>

2462
01:38:53,800 --> 01:38:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because you didn't seem to need any.</font>

2463
01:38:55,120 --> 01:38:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You did everything all by yourself.</font>

2464
01:38:56,520 --> 01:38:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Seeing him in the crowd,
yet having no chance to draw close]</font>

2465
01:39:00,360 --> 01:39:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You seemed so busy all the time.</font>

2466
01:39:03,000 --> 01:39:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no idea what you were up to.</font>

2467
01:39:09,000 --> 01:39:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was chopping vegetables.</font>

2468
01:39:23,200 --> 01:39:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So when you meet someone you like,</font>

2469
01:39:24,280 --> 01:39:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you very proactive?</font>

2470
01:39:26,360 --> 01:39:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not really.</font>

2471
01:39:27,200 --> 01:39:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not?</font>

2472
01:39:29,720 --> 01:39:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then what kind of person are you?</font>

2473
01:39:32,520 --> 01:39:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For example, once I know</font>

2474
01:39:34,120 --> 01:39:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like this person,</font>

2475
01:39:34,880 --> 01:39:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I know how she feels too,</font>

2476
01:39:36,640 --> 01:39:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then I'll be very proactive.</font>

2477
01:39:37,480 --> 01:39:38,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Becomes very proactive once
mutual feelings are confirmed]</font>

2478
01:39:39,440 --> 01:39:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'm the same.</font>

2479
01:39:41,880 --> 01:39:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like, I need to be sure about
how the other person feels.</font>

2480
01:39:44,880 --> 01:39:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was really nervous
coming to this dating show,</font>

2481
01:39:46,800 --> 01:39:48,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because I was so afraid</font>

2482
01:39:48,240 --> 01:39:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't meet my type.</font>

2483
01:39:50,880 --> 01:39:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2484
01:39:52,880 --> 01:39:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then I met you.</font>

2485
01:39:59,560 --> 01:40:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[And then I met you]</font>

2486
01:40:08,320 --> 01:40:10,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wondering why it felt like fate.</font>

2487
01:40:10,240 --> 01:40:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's because my former name was Yuting.</font>

2488
01:40:13,120 --> 01:40:14,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is true, it really is.</font>

2489
01:40:14,160 --> 01:40:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not lying to you.</font>

2490
01:40:16,800 --> 01:40:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it was such
an amazing coincidence,</font>

2491
01:40:19,640 --> 01:40:21,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then I wanted to
get to know you better.</font>

2492
01:40:25,080 --> 01:40:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you usually seem like...</font>

2493
01:40:27,920 --> 01:40:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a very quiet person.</font>

2494
01:40:29,880 --> 01:40:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I was a bit hesitant</font>

2495
01:40:31,280 --> 01:40:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to initiate a conversation with you.</font>

2496
01:40:33,120 --> 01:40:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I'm not sure,</font>

2497
01:40:33,800 --> 01:40:35,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd worry that you
might find it annoying,</font>

2498
01:40:35,240 --> 01:40:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or that you'd think it's just weird.</font>

2499
01:40:39,320 --> 01:40:42,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I really wanted to take today's date</font>

2500
01:40:42,160 --> 01:40:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to get to know you a bit more.</font>

2501
01:40:43,640 --> 01:40:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In short, I want to get to know you]</font>

2502
01:40:47,440 --> 01:40:48,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

2503
01:40:50,960 --> 01:40:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because it's only day two.</font>

2504
01:40:55,160 --> 01:40:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I know.</font>

2505
01:40:56,840 --> 01:40:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though I don't know
what will happen next,</font>

2506
01:40:58,800 --> 01:41:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think</font>

2507
01:41:00,320 --> 01:41:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can talk more,</font>

2508
01:41:02,360 --> 01:41:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or get to know each
other a little better.</font>

2509
01:41:07,280 --> 01:41:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sounds good.</font>

2510
01:41:18,720 --> 01:41:21,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because the kind of personality I like</font>

2511
01:41:21,200 --> 01:41:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is someone who is mature and steady.</font>

2512
01:41:23,640 --> 01:41:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ideally, emotionally stable.</font>

2513
01:41:28,040 --> 01:41:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't really like
people who are impulsive,</font>

2514
01:41:29,960 --> 01:41:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hot-tempered,</font>

2515
01:41:31,560 --> 01:41:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or overly moody.</font>

2516
01:41:33,880 --> 01:41:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like I just can't handle them.</font>

2517
01:41:35,880 --> 01:41:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it.</font>

2518
01:41:38,560 --> 01:41:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So who did you choose for the
animal pick on the first day?</font>

2519
01:41:40,960 --> 01:41:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You.</font>

2520
01:41:42,120 --> 01:41:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I chose you.</font>

2521
01:41:42,880 --> 01:41:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I chose you]</font>

2522
01:41:44,480 --> 01:41:45,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

2523
01:41:48,680 --> 01:41:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. I said I have</font>

2524
01:41:49,640 --> 01:41:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an Abyssinian at home.</font>

2525
01:41:50,880 --> 01:41:52,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, now I remember.</font>

2526
01:41:53,240 --> 01:41:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You forgot about this.</font>

2527
01:41:55,320 --> 01:41:56,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I... wait,</font>

2528
01:41:57,520 --> 01:42:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I asked you at the dining table.</font>

2529
01:42:00,000 --> 01:42:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember now.</font>

2530
01:42:00,760 --> 01:42:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't know</font>

2531
01:42:01,520 --> 01:42:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you picked the Abyssinian
Cat on the first day.</font>

2532
01:42:03,640 --> 01:42:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I was the last guy to appear,</font>

2533
01:42:05,560 --> 01:42:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and before I chose you,
you already had three votes.</font>

2534
01:42:08,360 --> 01:42:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

2535
01:42:09,880 --> 01:42:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the time,
I strolled over to your side,</font>

2536
01:42:11,040 --> 01:42:12,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I felt...</font>

2537
01:42:12,160 --> 01:42:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it felt meant to be.</font>

2538
01:42:13,080 --> 01:42:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Plus, the picture looked really nice,
right?</font>

2539
01:42:16,600 --> 01:42:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I just picked it.</font>

2540
01:42:23,920 --> 01:42:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I am someone who believes in fate]
Because I'm a huge believer in fate,</font>

2541
01:42:26,840 --> 01:42:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I totally believe in it.</font>

2542
01:42:29,400 --> 01:42:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Me too] Me too.</font>

2543
01:42:30,480 --> 01:42:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I feel like</font>

2544
01:42:30,960 --> 01:42:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">anything forced...</font>

2545
01:42:34,040 --> 01:42:35,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a relationship,</font>

2546
01:42:35,160 --> 01:42:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if getting to know someone
feels so exhausting</font>

2547
01:42:36,440 --> 01:42:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or draining,</font>

2548
01:42:37,680 --> 01:42:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then maybe</font>

2549
01:42:38,080 --> 01:42:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they're just not meant to be together.</font>

2550
01:42:41,840 --> 01:42:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If two people are destined</font>

2551
01:42:43,680 --> 01:42:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to meet or be together,</font>

2552
01:42:45,560 --> 01:42:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it seems no matter what they go through,</font>

2553
01:42:47,040 --> 01:42:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they'll end up together in the end.</font>

2554
01:42:55,760 --> 01:42:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you move</font>

2555
01:42:57,720 --> 01:42:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to another city for your partner?</font>

2556
01:42:59,040 --> 01:43:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Would you move to another
city for your partner?]</font>

2557
01:43:00,560 --> 01:43:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would.</font>

2558
01:43:01,240 --> 01:43:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely.</font>

2559
01:43:01,880 --> 01:43:02,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2560
01:43:02,240 --> 01:43:04,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does your job allow it?</font>

2561
01:43:04,240 --> 01:43:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My job allows it,</font>

2562
01:43:04,920 --> 01:43:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because I travel around a lot for work,</font>

2563
01:43:09,000 --> 01:43:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so yeah.</font>

2564
01:43:11,200 --> 01:43:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,
lately I've just been on the move...</font>

2565
01:43:13,880 --> 01:43:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">going everywhere.</font>

2566
01:43:15,800 --> 01:43:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes for work,</font>

2567
01:43:16,560 --> 01:43:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sometimes just for fun.</font>

2568
01:43:18,560 --> 01:43:21,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've moved out of my previous city.</font>

2569
01:43:21,240 --> 01:43:22,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Already moved out.</font>

2570
